label":"","value":"Regular Price : 14,500৳","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"","label":"","value":"Product ID : 609","href":null,"plain":true},{"cls":"product-stock in-stock","label":"Status:","value":"In Stock","href":null,"plain":false},{"cls":"product-manufacturer","label":"Brands:","value":"NETGEAR","href":"/netgear","plain":false},{"cls":"product-model","label":"Model:","value":"Netgear GS324","href":null,"plain":false}],"minimum":"","price":{"new":"13,500৳","old":"14,500৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax: 13,500৳","discounts":[]},"request":false,"askText":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"609","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: Netgear GS324","c":[]},{"h":"Ports: 24 x Gigabit Ethernet","c":[]},{"h":"Switch Type: Unmanaged","c":[]},{"h":"Switching Capacity: 48 Gbps","c":[]},{"h":"MAC Address Table: 8K","c":[]},{"h":"Jumbo Frame: Up to 9,216 bytes","c":[]},{"h":"Mounting Options: Rackmount, Wall-mount, Desktop","c":[]},{"h":"Standards: IEEE 802.3, 802.3u, 802.3ab, 802.3az","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 03 Years","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Unmanaged Switch</p><p><br></p><p>The Netgear GS324 24-Port Gigabit Rackmount Switch is a high-performance, reliable, and cost-effective networking solution designed for small to medium businesses, offices, schools, and enterprise environments. With 24 Gigabit Ethernet ports, this unmanaged switch delivers fast, stable, and seamless wired network connectivity without any configuration.</p><p><br></p><p>Built with a durable metal chassis and fanless silent operation, the Netgear GS324 ensures long-term performance and quiet operation, making it ideal for rackmount, wall-mount, or desktop installations.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p><br></p><ul><li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"973\"><p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"973\"><strong data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"879\">24 x Gigabit Ethernet Ports (10/100/1000 Mbps)</strong><br data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"882\">\nHigh-speed data transfer for computers, servers, printers, IP cameras, and access points.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1096\">\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1096\"><strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1011\">Unmanaged Plug-and-Play Design</strong><br data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\">\nNo configuration required—simply connect devices and start networking instantly.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1205\">\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1205\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\">Rackmount &amp; Desktop Ready</strong><br data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\nSupports standard 19-inch rack mounting and flexible placement options.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1309\">\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1237\">Fanless Silent Operation</strong><br data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1240\">\nIdeal for noise-sensitive environments like offices and classrooms.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1400\">\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1400\"><strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1338\">Durable Metal Housing</strong><br data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1341\">\nEnterprise-grade build quality for long-term reliability.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1534\">\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1448\">Energy Efficient Ethernet (IEEE 802.3az)</strong><br data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1451\">\nAutomatically reduces power consumption to save energy and lower operating costs.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1656\">\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1574\">Auto-Negotiation &amp; Auto-MDI/MDIX</strong><br data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1577\">\nAutomatically detects device speed and cable type—no crossover cables needed.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1777\">\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1777\"><strong data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1694\">Jumbo Frame Support (Up to 9K)</strong><br data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1697\">\nImproves performance for large file transfers and data-intensive applications.</p></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco Nexus 9300 N9K-C93180YC-EX 48x 10/25GbE SFP28 + 6x 100GbE QSFP28 Network Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-9300-n9k-c93180yc-ex-48x-1025gbe-sfp28-6x-100gbe-qsfp28-network-switch","now":"155,000৳","old":"160,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ L3 Web Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-l3-web-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"24,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco Nexus N3K-3064PQ-10GX –48-Port 10G SFP+ Switch","href":"/cisco-nexus-n3k-3064pq-10gx-%E2%80%9348-port-10g-sfp-switch","now":"70,000৳","old":"75,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba Networking CX 8325-32C 32-Port 100G QSFP+/QSFP28 Data Center/Core Switch","href":"/hpe-aruba-networking-cx-8325-32c-32-port-100g-qsfpqsfp28-data-centercore-switch","now":"270,000৳","old":"280,000৳","single":""},{"name":"BDCOM S2900-8T4X 4-Port 10G + 8-Port Gigabit L3-Lite Managed Switch","href":"/bdcom-s2900-8t4x-4-port-10g-8-port-gigabit-l3-lite-managed-switch","now":"14,500৳","old":"15,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 8-Port 10G SFP+ 4x10G SFP+ 4x10GBase-T RJ45 L2 Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-8-port-10g-sfp-4x10g-sfp-4x10gbase-t-rj45-l2-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"25,000৳","old":"26,000৳","single":""},{"name":"XikeStor 4-Port 2.5G & 2-Port 10G Simple L2 Smart Managed Ethernet Network Switch","href":"/xikestor-4-port-25g-and-2-port-10g-simple-l2-smart-managed-ethernet-network-switch","now":"8,000৳","old":"8,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei ekit